<title>USA: Ducommun Inc Q3 sales, net income rise.</title>
<headline>Ducommun Inc Q3 sales, net income rise.</headline>
<dateline>LOS ANGELES 1996-10-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three Months Ended     Nine Months Ended</p>
<p>			   Sep 28,    Sep 30,    Sep 28,    Sep 30,</p>
<p>				1996	1995	 1996	 1995</p>
<p> Net Sales	    $ 29,778   $ 24,080   $ 82,439   $ 67,903</p>
<p>Earnings Before Interest</p>
<p>  and Taxes		4,050	3,221	9,630	7,292</p>
<p> Interest Expense	(235)	(984)	(932)    (2,853)</p>
<p> Income Tax Expense  (1,068)	(584)    (2,435)    (1,201)</p>
<p> Net Income		2,747	1,653	6,263	3,238</p>
<p> EPS: Primary	     0.35	 0.34	 0.92	 0.68</p>
<p>   Fully Diluted	  0.35	 0.27	 0.83	 0.57</p>
<p>Wgtd Avg Shrs:</p>
<p>    Primary	  7,823,125  4,880,253  6,837,467  4,783,269</p>
<p>    Fully Diluted  7,845,030  7,706,693  7,857,593  7,703,866</p>
<p>		     (in thousands, except share data)</p>
<p>NOTE: The third quarter results include the financial results of MechTronics of Arizona Corp, which was acquired at the end of the second quarter.</p>
